\newlabel{fig:monte_carlo_cpu}{{18}{34}{Per-step CPU cost across wind speeds, all seven manual-bypass controllers (log scale, $T_s=\SI {100}{ms}$ budget marked). Cost remains approximately flat across wind speed for every controller, confirming that the manual-bypass forward-pass cost is a property of the model architecture, not of the operating condition (Section~\ref {subsec:monte_carlo})}{figure.caption.36}{}}
